        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.shineonsalem.org/idanha-is-the-heartland-of-the-cascades/"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Idanha sits on the border of Marion and Linn counties, with the North Santiam River separating the two settled areas.",
